{"2381770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Arcane Audit", "steam_appid": 2381770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happens when a company's CEO is corrupted by dark magic? The tax forms don't get filed. You are an IRS agent that must battle through his minions, navigate an office building that has been twisted by magic, and find the proper tax forms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Souls-like Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in strategic combat as you battle your way through a corrupted office building. Dodge enemy attacks and use a wide variety of weapons and abilities to defeat your foes. If you want to work for the IRS, you have to be willing to use lethal force.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381770/extras/dd9db310648cf744dc1e632ffa19a875.poster.avif?t=1784646232\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381770/extras/dd9db310648cf744dc1e632ffa19a875.webm?t=1784646232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381770/extras/dd9db310648cf744dc1e632ffa19a875.mp4?t=1784646232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will encounter many types of employees, from the fire wizards in IT, to the ice golems of the accounting department. None may be allowed to stand in the way of your audit.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381770/extras/7ef7b93c63677e67b0280961cb16f540.poster.avif?t=1784646232\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381770/extras/7ef7b93c63677e67b0280961cb16f540.webm?t=1784646232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381770/extras/7ef7b93c63677e67b0280961cb16f540.mp4?t=1784646232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight managers complicit in the tax fraud! Engage in literal boss fights against the head of each department as you make your way closer to the CEO.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381770/extras/04d6f20b5ca8e6770a420111bedfcc30.poster.avif?t=1784646232\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381770/extras/04d6f20b5ca8e6770a420111bedfcc30.webm?t=1784646232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381770/extras/04d6f20b5ca8e6770a420111bedfcc30.mp4?t=1784646232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow In Power</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect fines from those that stand in your way and use this money to level up and become even more lethal.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381770/extras/2a33ccdbec515bba2362b373c717d53f.poster.avif?t=1784646232\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381770/extras/2a33ccdbec515bba2362b373c717d53f.webm?t=1784646232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381770/extras/2a33ccdbec515bba2362b373c717d53f.mp4?t=1784646232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the offices of this failing business you will find many arcane secrets that can be used to increase your power or grant you new abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381770/extras/b82e13814792c2ea69b298feb090a91e.poster.avif?t=1784646232\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381770/extras/b82e13814792c2ea69b298feb090a91e.webm?t=1784646232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381770/extras/b82e13814792c2ea69b298feb090a91e.mp4?t=1784646232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happens when a company's CEO is corrupted by dark magic? The tax forms don't get filed. You are an IRS agent that must battle through his minions, navigate an office building that has been twisted by magic, and find the proper tax forms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Souls-like Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in strategic combat as you battle your way through a corrupted office building. Dodge enemy attacks and use a wide variety of weapons and abilities to defeat your foes. If you want to work for the IRS, you have to be willing to use lethal force.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381770/extras/dd9db310648cf744dc1e632ffa19a875.poster.avif?t=1784646232\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381770/extras/dd9db310648cf744dc1e632ffa19a875.webm?t=1784646232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381770/extras/dd9db310648cf744dc1e632ffa19a875.mp4?t=1784646232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will encounter many types of employees, from the fire wizards in IT, to the ice golems of the accounting department. None may be allowed to stand in the way of your audit.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381770/extras/7ef7b93c63677e67b0280961cb16f540.poster.avif?t=1784646232\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381770/extras/7ef7b93c63677e67b0280961cb16f540.webm?t=1784646232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381770/extras/7ef7b93c63677e67b0280961cb16f540.mp4?t=1784646232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight managers complicit in the tax fraud! Engage in literal boss fights against the head of each department as you make your way closer to the CEO.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381770/extras/04d6f20b5ca8e6770a420111bedfcc30.poster.avif?t=1784646232\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381770/extras/04d6f20b5ca8e6770a420111bedfcc30.webm?t=1784646232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381770/extras/04d6f20b5ca8e6770a420111bedfcc30.mp4?t=1784646232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow In Power</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect fines from those that stand in your way and use this money to level up and become even more lethal.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381770/extras/2a33ccdbec515bba2362b373c717d53f.poster.avif?t=1784646232\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381770/extras/2a33ccdbec515bba2362b373c717d53f.webm?t=1784646232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381770/extras/2a33ccdbec515bba2362b373c717d53f.mp4?t=1784646232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the offices of this failing business you will find many arcane secrets that can be used to increase your power or grant you new abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381770/extras/b82e13814792c2ea69b298feb090a91e.poster.avif?t=1784646232\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381770/extras/b82e13814792c2ea69b298feb090a91e.webm?t=1784646232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381770/extras/b82e13814792c2ea69b298feb090a91e.mp4?t=1784646232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Arcane Audit is an IRS themed souls-like. Fight wizards, monsters, and middle managers. Explore the offices of a corrupted business and uncover the secrets hidden there. Grow in power and discover new weapons and arcane abilities.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381770/header.jpg?t=1784646232", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381770/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784646232", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381770/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784646232", "website": "https://www.brokenbeakers